    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nFix multi-turn speculative TPOT bubbles on Ascend when chunked prefill is disabled and scheduling is prefill-first (Ascend/sglang #1093).\r\n\r\n- While speculative decoding is on, mixed chunk is off, and a decode batch is running, skip new prefills **and** in-flight `chunked_req` continuations so decode is not starved.\r\n- If `--chunked-prefill-size` is unset or `<= 0` under EAGLE/NEXTN, default it to **1024**. An explicit positive value is unchanged.\r\n\r\n## NPU retest (Qwen3-Next W8A8 + NEXTN, C=2, generated-shared-prefix)\r\n\r\nFormal baseline before the fix: Mean TPOT delta **-22.82** (fail), Max ITL about 4s.\r\n\r\nAdopted scheme (decode-prefer + chunked 1024), 10/10 runs with |delta| <= 1 ms (max |delta| 0.92):\r\n\r\n| Run | A | B | delta |\r\n|-----|---|---|-------|\r\n| 1 | 14.56 | 15.39 | +0.83 |\r\n| 2 | 15.40 | 15.17 | -0.23 |\r\n| 3 | 15.03 | 15.20 | +0.17 |\r\n| 4 | 15.23 | 15.19 | -0.04 |\r\n| 5 | 14.76 | 15.07 | +0.31 |\r\n| 6 | 15.53 | 15.21 | -0.32 |\r\n| 7 | 15.26 | 15.04 | -0.22 |\r\n| 8 | 14.16 | 15.05 | +0.89 |\r\n| 9 | 16.25 | 15.33 | -0.92 |\r\n| 10 | 15.02 | 15.49 | +0.47 |\r\n\r\nV2 + chunked 2048 was only 8/10, so 1024 is the default.\r\n\r\n## Related\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/Ascend/sglang/issues/1093\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [x] 10x A/B bench on Atlas 800T A2, |Mean TPOT delta| <= 1 ms\r\n- [ ] Upstream CI\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38060702824](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38060702824)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38060702727](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38060702727)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38060702832](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38060702832)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
