    {
      "body": "### Follow-up after DeepSeek Pro/Flash review\n\nPushed to tip:\n- `cb33322` — decode-prefer V2 no longer stalls an in-flight `chunked_req` (only defers *new* prefills while decode is running); explicit `--chunked-prefill-size 0` is left alone (only `None` / negative auto-defaults to 1024 under EAGLE/NEXTN)",
